r execution. Repository access failure must warn during offline/static check when verification cannot be attempted and must fail install before mutation when source cannot be resolved. Credentials and signing identities must never come from the package descriptor. Research authoritative Git, Go build, platform signing/notarization and sandbox constraints as needed. Persist the decision and threat model as a new task-scoped outcome resource, include concrete JSON examples and normative MUST/MUST NOT recommendations, record source links, then route to to-review for an independent architecture review.
